<title>USA: National Energy sets stock buyback.</title>
<headline>National Energy sets stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Energy Group Inc said Tuesday that directors approved a plan to purchase up to five percent of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>Purchases may be made in the open market from time to time, the company said. It has 36.1 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>&quot;In the past few months shares of NEGX have been trading at levels well below what we believe is the fair market value for our common stock,&quot; chief executive Miles D. Bender said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
